# What Friends Are For's Prog bounds: a level 75 Warrior in Nashmau with a Chunk of Tin Ore, a Cobalt Jellyfish and an
# Imperial Bronze Piece (GMs set every state). Available at Prog 2: Tsetseroon: nil: 4 (the default; no section holds
# Prog 2). Accepted at Prog 2: the tin, the jellyfish and the bronze piece together: nil (the trade must be exactly the
# two). Accepted at Prog 5: Tsetseroon: nil: 4. Aydeewa Subterrane: accepted at Prog 4 with the stew held (a GM): qm9:
# nil.
lists Nashmau/Tsetseroon/onTrigger Nashmau/Tsetseroon/onTrade AydeewaSubterrane/qm9/onTrigger
char zone=Nashmau pos=-11.5,-6,68.971 job=WAR lvl=75
item ChunkOfTinOre
item CobaltJellyfish
item ImperialBronzePiece
quest AhtUrhgan.WhatFriendsAreFor available
charvar Quest[6][19]Prog 2
login
trigger Tsetseroon                      # available, Prog 2: nil: 4 (the default)
finish-if-event
quest AhtUrhgan.WhatFriendsAreFor accepted
charvar Quest[6][19]Prog 2
trade Tsetseroon ChunkOfTinOre x1 CobaltJellyfish x1 ImperialBronzePiece x1   # three items: nil
finish-if-event
charvar Quest[6][19]Prog 5
trigger Tsetseroon                      # accepted, Prog 5: nil: 4 (the default)
finish-if-event
keyitem PotOfTsetseroonsStew            # a GM
charvar Quest[6][19]Prog 4
warp -404.4,6.514,-440.237 AydeewaSubterrane
trigger qm9                             # Prog 4, the stew held: nil
finish-if-event
